physicalRef: payment/database
description: "Electricity revenue-protection Link Analysis showcase - One row per bill payment by a credit (smart-meter) account: the instant, the amount and the bank account it came from (blank for cash). One landed extract; the next month is in data/staged. Landed by the payment Pipeline. Synthetic."
eventDate: paid_at
columns[5]{name,type,classification}:
